                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5978: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Costa
                        Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">De Lambert</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-14T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>30. Your 60, September 13, 5 p.m. Please watch developments carefully and keep
                    the Department and the Legation at Managua fully informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
